The files of this directory derived from Microsoft GW-BASIC (1983) are under
the licence below. Each says so in its first lines ("Derived from Microsoft
GW-BASIC"): the translated modules in res/, p1/ and p2/, gwbasic.inc, and
test/mbf.py and test/basic.py. res/oem.s, the console's OEM layer, is partly
derived ("Partly derived from Microsoft GW-BASIC"): the routines it names as
translated (OUTDO, LPOUT1, CRDO, CRDONZ, CRFIN, FINLPT, FINPRT, ISFLIO, SCNSEM, ITSCTC
and CNTCCN) are under the licence below, the rest of it is the project's own.
The rest (the loader, res/todo*.s's stand-ins, the tools, the link configs,
the Makefile, ledger.txt, srcnames.txt and the tests) are the project's own,
under the repository's LICENSE.

